/* Tappable "spend it" nudge rows (unopened chests / free spin) — clearly a call to action. */
/* Keep the dark ink on ALL link states — the global `a:visited` rule (0,1,1) otherwise outranks this and
   repaints the text muted grey once the target page has been visited, killing contrast on the gold pill. */
